# revealed solutions — deliberate, temporary, never committed
**/SOLUTION-REVEALED.md
**/solution-revealed/

# generated book artifacts
book/

# assembled prompts — scripts/prompt.py --out writes these. They are derived from
# prompts/, docs/ and a unit's BRIEF.md, so they go stale the moment a ledger
# changes. Regenerate, never commit: python scripts/prompt.py ch-22 --kind lesson
.ch-*-prompt.md

# per-chapter research scratch from an authoring session
.ch-*-research.md
.current-research*.md

# shopify cli / theme dev
# playground/ is the learner's live sandbox: pull a real theme in and break it.
# Everything there is ignored except the README that explains what it is for.
playground/*
!playground/README.md
.shopify/
node_modules/

# python artifacts from scripts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# os / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.log
